  <title>Hello, world</title>
  <link>https://maopeter.github.io/blog/posts/welcome/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<p>This is the first post on the site. It exists mostly to verify that the things I care about render correctly.</p>
<section id="math" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="math">Math</h2>
<p>Inline: the Euler identity is <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?e%5E%7Bi%5Cpi%7D%20+%201%20=%200">.</p>
<p>Display: <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cint_%7B-%5Cinfty%7D%5E%7B%5Cinfty%7D%20e%5E%7B-x%5E2%7D%5C,dx%20=%20%5Csqrt%7B%5Cpi%7D.%0A"></p>
</section>
